WEBVTT

00:04.350 --> 00:08.360
we found that the effects of the
Lightless Realm on their psyches differed.

00:08.940 --> 00:11.780
And based on that analysis,

00:11.780 --> 00:15.320
we now have a hypothesis for
preventing the Lightless Realm's effects.

00:18.790 --> 00:23.580
Sensei, I can't concentrate on the
lecture because they won't shut up.

00:25.880 --> 00:29.340
They say stuff like "Is it all right for someone like him to be a student?"

00:29.340 --> 00:30.800
It's pissin' me off.

00:30.800 --> 00:31.970
What?!

00:31.970 --> 00:34.260
Did I think out loud?

00:34.260 --> 00:35.220
No...

00:35.300 --> 00:37.430
I thought as much.

00:37.430 --> 00:39.390
That's called "synchronization of thoughts."

00:40.520 --> 00:45.730
It is believed to be the condition for
staying safe within the Lightless Realm.

00:45.730 --> 00:48.020
Synchronization of thoughts?

00:48.020 --> 00:51.900
You were all chosen because of that potential.

00:51.900 --> 00:56.070
And the training on the deserted island
confirmed that all of you have that ability.

00:56.660 --> 00:58.280
Does anything come to mind?

00:59.910 --> 01:04.080
Back then, we were all trying to go to the same spot.

01:04.660 --> 01:07.330
That was synchronization of thoughts?

01:11.210 --> 01:12.510
That's right.

01:12.510 --> 01:15.470
The ability's still preferential for now,

01:15.470 --> 01:19.140
so we've been observing the strong
bondings between one pair at a time.

01:19.470 --> 01:23.680
In the end, we'd like to make sure that
all of you are connected to each other.

01:36.070 --> 01:41.660
The Dark Metal

01:36.110 --> 01:36.150
The Dark Metal

01:41.660 --> 01:46.080
Night turns to day, and day turns to night. Our wishes have wilted away

01:46.080 --> 01:50.250
Where did the person I want to meet go?

01:50.250 --> 01:54.710
Interlocking these fingers with my beloved

01:54.710 --> 01:58.470
Even though I can't feel them, I continue to live

01:58.510 --> 02:03.100
When the flower's petals

02:03.100 --> 02:07.230
Are plucked off by the wind's playful gale

02:07.230 --> 02:11.690
They are scattered in every direction

02:11.690 --> 02:17.030
Even if you long for it

02:18.030 --> 02:22.740
Don't disappear, just don't

02:22.740 --> 02:26.540
I can even give everything else away if I have to

02:26.540 --> 02:31.380
You were there, and I was there with you

02:31.380 --> 02:35.710
Let me take in these memories

02:35.710 --> 02:42.640
These brief moments are connected, turning it into eternity

02:59.780 --> 03:01.490
I don't get this at all!

03:01.490 --> 03:02.870
Like seriously.

03:02.490 --> 03:07.500
Episode 5
Self in Vain

03:02.870 --> 03:04.580
Our thoughts get connected?

03:04.580 --> 03:06.290
That's so weird!

03:06.290 --> 03:09.660
And of all things, I pair best with you?

03:09.660 --> 03:10.790
What a drag.

03:10.790 --> 03:13.290
I should be saying that.

03:13.290 --> 03:16.000
And the other pair was Sasame and Minashi?

03:16.000 --> 03:19.800
Apparently I'm not linked to anyone in particular,

03:19.800 --> 03:24.510
and that makes me slightly lonely—
or rather, I'm always like that...

03:24.510 --> 03:26.890
Then you can be with Heito instead of me!

03:32.270 --> 03:34.480
Well, it must really suck for her.

03:34.480 --> 03:37.320
To be told she's synchronized with that murderer.

03:37.320 --> 03:40.400
It must suck for Akashi as well.

03:40.400 --> 03:42.740
His partner isn't even human.

03:42.740 --> 03:45.120
Yeah, that's true.

03:55.920 --> 03:57.420
Good work today.

03:57.420 --> 03:59.300
It's starting to stabilize a lot more now.

03:59.670 --> 04:01.800
Can I ask you something?

04:01.800 --> 04:02.840
What's that?

04:02.840 --> 04:06.640
Hasn't this thing killed another human before?

04:08.100 --> 04:12.390
I keep seeing these aberrant images.

04:12.390 --> 04:14.060
I can also see the redness of blood.

04:14.690 --> 04:19.400
I don't know what you had it do,
but that must be from when it killed.

04:19.400 --> 04:20.820
That can't possibly be true!

04:22.030 --> 04:25.200
The Argent has never laid hands on a human.

04:25.200 --> 04:30.790
If you saw something like that, I'm sure it was jus
t out of confusion—a memory that never happened.

04:31.120 --> 04:32.290
Memory?

04:32.290 --> 04:34.040
Don't you mean a recording?

04:35.790 --> 04:37.880
You treat it as if it's human.

04:37.880 --> 04:41.170
When you become a researcher,
do you start lusting after mechas?

04:41.170 --> 04:42.630
Akashi!

04:46.640 --> 04:49.510
Well, it's okay if you don't want to answer.

04:49.510 --> 04:53.230
Because either way, this machine is well suited for me.

04:56.270 --> 04:57.900
The Reaper...

04:57.900 --> 05:01.190
For someone like me who truly
wishes for another person's death.

05:03.190 --> 05:04.070
Just die!

05:05.030 --> 05:07.410
That's so amazing, Aoshi!

05:07.410 --> 05:11.200
To be assigned as a pilot for the
Lightless Realm's investigation team.

05:12.080 --> 05:16.000
They went so far as to assign him, so it must be a big deal!

05:16.000 --> 05:17.750
You exaggerate.

05:18.040 --> 05:20.290
Not at all. Everyone says so.

05:20.290 --> 05:22.510
Like a black hen laying white eggs.

05:24.220 --> 05:25.220
<i>Just die.</i>

05:26.220 --> 05:28.390
An accident during their investigation...

05:29.220 --> 05:31.470
And Akashi-kun is still so young.

05:31.470 --> 05:33.310
What a pity...

05:33.310 --> 05:37.190
I'll protect Akashi from now on.

05:37.190 --> 05:39.900
You're the one who deserves to die the most.

05:40.900 --> 05:42.400
It's you, yet...

05:43.110 --> 05:46.900
Aoshi, during the investigation of the Lightless Realm...

05:47.820 --> 05:53.870
The Vess came back, but Aoshi's
corpse was nowhere to be found...

06:01.460 --> 06:04.380
Why are you... smiling?

06:13.810 --> 06:14.770
Akashi?

06:16.430 --> 06:18.940
Thanks for the hard work.

06:26.190 --> 06:28.700
Pass this item to the top brasses for me.

06:28.700 --> 06:29.820
Sure.

06:31.910 --> 06:33.410
H-Hold on!

06:33.410 --> 06:33.830
Akashi...

06:34.290 --> 06:37.040
Those children... They're just novices!

06:37.040 --> 06:41.630
And that novice is the only one who can pilot the Reaper.

06:41.630 --> 06:42.750
But...

06:42.750 --> 06:47.630
Besides, I need him to work a little bit harder.

06:47.630 --> 06:51.140
One of his friends has passed the point of no return.

07:05.020 --> 07:05.940
Sasame?

07:06.780 --> 07:08.030
Minashi-kun.

07:08.030 --> 07:09.990
What are you doing?

07:14.490 --> 07:18.660
Everyone hates it after all.

07:18.660 --> 07:20.620
The fact that our thoughts get connected.

07:21.710 --> 07:28.090
In the past, I've been able to figure out
what others think, though only once in a while.

07:28.090 --> 07:30.420
And that's why people avoided me.

07:30.420 --> 07:32.890
Everyone in this group does too, after all...

07:33.220 --> 07:35.510
Didn't we have fun at the training camp?

07:35.510 --> 07:40.430
And they hate it because they think they'll just be used by the adults.

07:40.430 --> 07:41.140
But...

07:41.520 --> 07:45.270
It's more fun when we're connected, so of course it's a wonderful thing.

07:45.270 --> 07:46.610
Come on! Up high!

07:51.570 --> 07:53.070
Minashi-kun...

08:03.920 --> 08:05.500
What are you doing?

08:07.290 --> 08:09.880
Just feeling a bit dizzy...

08:10.970 --> 08:15.260
You really are somehow useless all the time.

08:15.260 --> 08:16.010
Come on...

08:16.550 --> 08:18.140
Don't touch me!

08:19.140 --> 08:21.520
You heard her, Akashi.

08:28.020 --> 08:31.400
Leave Emiru to me, her partner.

08:31.400 --> 08:32.820
Right, Emiru?

08:34.490 --> 08:35.570
Yeah...

08:39.580 --> 08:41.410
Hey, Akashi...

08:42.710 --> 08:46.040
This place has turned to shit, too, huh?

08:49.500 --> 08:53.010
Not telling Akashi anything more was the right thing to do.

08:53.630 --> 08:58.010
With this body that's like an Admonition, I'm sure he'd hate you.

08:58.640 --> 09:01.310
Ugly, filthy...

09:01.310 --> 09:02.770
The only one who can accept you...

09:07.310 --> 09:08.520
...is me.

09:24.750 --> 09:29.670
I'll have Heito and Emiru board the
Vesses during field training tomorrow.

09:29.670 --> 09:31.550
Field training?

09:31.550 --> 09:36.340
The location is an off-limits area roughly
ten kilometers outside the Lightless Realm.

09:37.510 --> 09:38.840
Isn't that dangerous?

09:38.840 --> 09:42.930
Ten kilometers outside would be a three-plus danger level.

09:43.350 --> 09:47.100
All of you will eventually enter the Lightless Realm.

09:47.100 --> 09:50.820
This will act as training and research so you can act when the time comes.

09:51.190 --> 09:54.030
We'll handle all the data acquisition and such.

09:54.030 --> 09:59.280
In any case, try to get as close as possible,
and if you feel it's getting too dangerous, you can retreat.

10:00.240 --> 10:03.120
Does it have to be me?

10:03.450 --> 10:06.830
Heito I get, but it's too much for Emiru.

10:06.830 --> 10:11.710
When we fought an Admonition,
she was so incompetent she was of no use.

10:11.710 --> 10:13.210
Akashi...

10:13.960 --> 10:18.130
Of all the pairings, Emiru and Heito's synchronicity was highest.

10:18.590 --> 10:23.180
We'd also like to confirm whether or not that thought synchronization

10:23.180 --> 10:26.560
can avoid the effects of the Lightless Realm.

10:26.560 --> 10:29.980
I understand how Emiru feels more than anyone.

10:34.940 --> 10:38.240
Admonitions tend to be more active during the night,

10:38.240 --> 10:40.740
so we'll avoid that and depart early in the morning.

10:42.030 --> 10:44.080
Try to get to sleep early tonight.

10:56.210 --> 10:59.170
Mari-chan from general affairs quit...

10:56.210 --> 10:59.170
Pub Ikuyoshi

10:57.300 --> 10:58.510
Welcome!

11:01.800 --> 11:05.560
Even if I wanted to change my mood, this place is filled with people I know.

11:05.560 --> 11:08.310
Beer & Fries

11:07.270 --> 11:08.310
Susan.

11:08.310 --> 11:10.520
Don't call me that.

11:10.520 --> 11:12.940
I didn't agree to it even when we were in school.

11:13.940 --> 11:15.070
Susan!

11:15.070 --> 11:17.820
You came here to IX so you could audit us, didn't you?

11:17.820 --> 11:19.280
Spit it out!

11:19.280 --> 11:22.570
Government employees can't
disobey orders from their superiors

11:23.910 --> 11:26.830
But to think that you, a researcher, couldn't either.

11:29.200 --> 11:31.250
I can't help it.

11:35.210 --> 11:38.510
I don't want to involve Akashi any more than now...

11:38.510 --> 11:39.510
But...

11:39.510 --> 11:43.510
Emiru is so like this... and that!

11:44.050 --> 11:47.260
And this and that...

11:47.260 --> 11:48.720
Like what?

11:48.720 --> 11:50.770
You okay, Kasane-san?

11:50.770 --> 11:53.190
It's fine to leave her alone.

11:53.190 --> 11:55.060
Mumyou-no-Teiou on the rocks.

11:55.060 --> 11:55.520
Sure.

11:56.110 --> 11:59.360
We can't help it...

12:16.460 --> 12:18.340
Planning to run away or something?

12:20.420 --> 12:21.260
Akashi...

12:21.880 --> 12:25.090
If you're insecure, fake an illness or whatever you want.

12:25.930 --> 12:30.390
That seductiveness you're so proud
of won't work on a female instructor.

12:31.270 --> 12:35.730
You're probably thinking I was brought up very poorly, right?

12:36.310 --> 12:40.110
I lost my parents inside the Lightless Realm...

12:42.360 --> 12:47.570
I was raised by my relatives, and I was always compared to their children...

12:48.580 --> 12:53.330
I was always depressed, so as soon as I got out of junior high, I left home and started working.

12:53.330 --> 12:56.210
However, nothing changed.

12:57.250 --> 12:59.710
But about a year ago,

13:00.050 --> 13:02.590
the one thing that changed was
how men started to look at me.

13:03.220 --> 13:08.680
The only thing I can be proud of is this body of mine... and this face...

13:09.140 --> 13:13.680
But a part of me thinks that's pretty pathetic.

13:14.350 --> 13:17.150
That's why being chosen for this was my big chance!

13:17.600 --> 13:22.360
I'll get results and look down
on the people who mocked me!

13:26.910 --> 13:29.030
I don't want it to end like this!

13:29.030 --> 13:30.620
Absolutely not!

13:30.620 --> 13:32.410
My life's finally about to start!

13:32.410 --> 13:34.580
The unlucky life I've led till now...

13:35.000 --> 13:38.920
I have to live my life to the fullest from now on or everything would've been for nothing!

13:39.540 --> 13:42.500
You make the investigation sound
like you're marching to your death.

13:45.010 --> 13:47.180
I want to defeat the Corpses.

13:47.890 --> 13:49.550
The Corpses?

13:49.550 --> 13:53.350
Well, they do say we were gathered for that purpose.

13:53.970 --> 13:56.980
That's the only way I can see.

13:56.980 --> 14:01.320
If I can get rid of the source of this, then maybe...

14:06.450 --> 14:09.110
I respect you just a bit.

14:09.110 --> 14:12.950
You're trapped by your past as well, but also have an eye on the future.

14:13.660 --> 14:16.120
You're trying to connect the past to the future.

14:16.910 --> 14:18.040
I'm still...

14:19.790 --> 14:23.590
I wish you were the one I synchronized with.

14:46.940 --> 14:48.490
Is she okay?

14:48.490 --> 14:50.530
Don't worry about her.

14:50.530 --> 14:52.830
You say that, but...

14:56.410 --> 15:02.330
If you keep drinking because it's hard,
you should hurry up and quit this job that puts

15:02.330 --> 15:04.460
innocent boys and girls in danger.

15:09.420 --> 15:10.550
And you three?

15:10.550 --> 15:11.300
Nothing wrong?

15:11.800 --> 15:15.180
I've never felt good since boarding this thing.

15:15.180 --> 15:16.560
Then don't come.

15:16.560 --> 15:18.520
Emiru and I can handle this.

15:18.520 --> 15:19.690
I'm going.

15:20.810 --> 15:23.940
If I can't disobey orders, there's no choice but to go.

15:27.990 --> 15:32.780
Hey, Iwato, do you remember when
the Lightless Realm was first created?

15:33.740 --> 15:35.370
Not at all.

15:35.370 --> 15:37.370
It's left my memory entirely.

15:38.910 --> 15:40.500
So you as well...

15:41.580 --> 15:43.580
M-Me too.

15:43.580 --> 15:44.460
You too, Mahmu?

15:45.170 --> 15:52.050
I don't remember the several months before and after the Lightless Realm was created...

15:52.050 --> 15:56.350
When I ask my mother, she says we struggled a bit with refugee life,

15:57.180 --> 16:00.230
but that I behaved like I always did.

16:00.600 --> 16:02.850
Isn't that pretty common?

16:02.850 --> 16:05.190
Like when you get so shocked you forget stuff.

16:05.190 --> 16:07.400
And we were kids too.

16:07.820 --> 16:10.320
Sasame, you okay with the vomit?

16:10.320 --> 16:11.110
Vomit?

16:11.530 --> 16:17.030
I was thinking it's kinda gross and
you'd surely be feeling the same way, too.

16:19.910 --> 16:23.710
Kasane Agura from the IX Development Division.

16:23.710 --> 16:27.460
Investigating the dangerous zone and training Team Gargouille.

16:28.340 --> 16:28.380
KEEP OUT

16:35.890 --> 16:37.470
It's the Lightless Realm.

16:38.640 --> 16:40.350
So creepy...

16:43.810 --> 16:47.940
Somehow the scenery makes me feel like I'm dreaming.

16:47.940 --> 16:51.190
A dream I despise—a nightmare.

16:51.650 --> 16:53.650
A dream, huh...

16:54.490 --> 16:56.740
We're at the 20km gate out now.

16:56.740 --> 17:00.120
From here on, the Argent will
take lead and head forward 10 km.

17:06.330 --> 17:06.920
Akashi...

17:15.680 --> 17:17.970
Four more kilometers to the ten-kilometer point.

17:17.970 --> 17:18.970
Slow down.

17:26.900 --> 17:30.150
Akashi, I'll catch up right now...

17:38.070 --> 17:39.570
What...

17:40.120 --> 17:41.370
What is this?

17:45.580 --> 17:46.540
Emiru!

17:47.670 --> 17:48.880
Stop, Emiru!

17:51.130 --> 17:52.750
This is the best!

17:52.750 --> 17:53.710
Heito?

17:54.340 --> 17:55.880
I can hear it.

17:55.880 --> 17:58.050
You are mine after all.

17:58.720 --> 17:59.720
What are you...

18:00.430 --> 18:03.100
Don't you feel it, my girl?

18:03.100 --> 18:04.730
The heartbeat of an Admonition.

18:04.730 --> 18:07.350
I don't feel anything like that...

18:07.730 --> 18:09.100
Emiru!

18:09.100 --> 18:11.400
You are an Admonition!

18:11.400 --> 18:13.730
Everyone will come to kill you!

18:13.730 --> 18:19.160
But you can't die—or rather,
I'd be troubled if you died, my girl!

18:19.160 --> 18:20.620
Stop it.

18:22.240 --> 18:27.710
You're going to show off that
ominous body of yours while you're alive!

18:27.710 --> 18:28.870
No!

18:28.870 --> 18:33.840
And they'll tear you apart and
examine every inch of that tattered body!

18:35.210 --> 18:36.210
No!

18:36.210 --> 18:37.590
Help me!

18:38.720 --> 18:40.470
Rest assured.

18:40.470 --> 18:44.180
I'll slowly savor every feeling of terror you have.

18:44.180 --> 18:44.930
No...

18:49.730 --> 18:50.650
Emiru!

18:50.650 --> 18:51.980
Retreat!

18:52.900 --> 18:54.570
Emiru, respond!

18:54.940 --> 18:57.860
Emiru, retreat! Please!

18:58.530 --> 19:00.410
No...

19:00.410 --> 19:02.570
Help me, Akashi...

19:02.910 --> 19:04.200
What's wrong?

19:04.200 --> 19:06.790
Akashi, get Emiru out of that Vess.

19:07.540 --> 19:10.120
It's possible her psyche has been invaded!

19:10.120 --> 19:11.540
Hurry!

19:11.540 --> 19:13.040
What's that supposed to mean?

19:13.420 --> 19:15.710
Akashi won't come to rescue you.

19:15.710 --> 19:17.920
He'll come to kill you instead!

19:18.760 --> 19:22.010
To come kill you now that you've become an Admonition!

19:22.510 --> 19:24.180
Akashi...

19:24.180 --> 19:25.010
Lies...

19:26.930 --> 19:27.470
No...

19:35.070 --> 19:35.900
An Admonition?

19:49.370 --> 19:50.790
We were caught off guard!

19:50.790 --> 19:52.790
You okay, Sasame?

19:52.790 --> 19:55.670
Y-Yes, thank you.

19:55.670 --> 19:56.840
Raika-san?

20:04.800 --> 20:06.260
Heito, do you copy?!

20:06.430 --> 20:09.720
While I keep the Admonition busy, rescue Emiru!

20:10.350 --> 20:13.850
You really don't get a thing about Emiru, do you?

20:13.850 --> 20:15.230
What?

20:15.230 --> 20:17.520
That Admonition <i>is</i> Emiru.

20:17.520 --> 20:21.860
Emiru created that because she was
afraid that you'd drag her out of there.

20:23.570 --> 20:25.490
What is he saying?

20:25.490 --> 20:26.490
No.

20:26.490 --> 20:28.450
It's just like he says.

20:28.450 --> 20:29.200
Right.

20:29.620 --> 20:31.540
That is Emiru-san.

20:31.540 --> 20:39.250
An Admonition is created when negative emotions left by the dead react with the Lightless Realm.

20:39.710 --> 20:43.970
That was the conclusion we made,
but those who have emotions that strong

20:44.720 --> 20:47.430
aren't necessarily limited to the dead.

20:50.810 --> 20:54.560
To think she would even create an Admonition.

20:55.150 --> 20:56.810
Hazaki Emiru.

20:56.810 --> 20:58.860
You're beyond my wildest dreams.

20:59.480 --> 21:01.940
Your specs are so overwhelmingly good.

21:06.070 --> 21:06.950
Emiru!

21:12.160 --> 21:13.000
Respond!

21:13.000 --> 21:15.710
Just like I thought, you're amazing!

21:15.710 --> 21:16.880
Look!

21:16.880 --> 21:18.460
See.

21:20.710 --> 21:22.420
Your child...

21:22.760 --> 21:26.380
You yourself are wounding Akashi!

21:27.340 --> 21:28.350
Akashi.

21:29.140 --> 21:29.930
Minashi?

21:29.930 --> 21:31.220
That's right.

21:31.220 --> 21:33.520
Why can I hear your voice?

21:33.520 --> 21:36.940
Akashi, you need to control her fearful heart.

21:36.940 --> 21:38.690
Emiru's fear?

21:39.310 --> 21:42.440
If you can, this Admonition will disappear.

21:48.030 --> 21:51.580
Emiru, I'm heading over now, so stay calm and wait.

21:52.200 --> 21:53.330
Akashi...

21:53.950 --> 21:54.960
No...

21:55.620 --> 21:57.040
Don't come here!

22:03.840 --> 22:05.090
This is...

22:05.090 --> 22:05.920
What is that?

22:06.510 --> 22:07.590
Emiru-san...

22:18.060 --> 22:19.270
Here!

22:19.270 --> 22:21.980
Here it comes, Emiru!

22:21.980 --> 22:25.030
Your terror is absolutely the best!

22:25.030 --> 22:28.990
You are my nightmare, and mine alone...

22:44.840 --> 22:55.470
Throwing away all my excuses, I traced over my abrased heart

22:55.470 --> 23:00.020
In the coldness of the locker room,

23:00.020 --> 23:06.480
Was an unfulfilled promise, locked away

23:06.990 --> 23:12.950
Dispel the darkness in this fallen world,

23:12.950 --> 23:17.500
And give me a reason why I should continue living

23:17.500 --> 23:22.880
The meaning of good-byes, the expectations of people,

23:22.880 --> 23:27.760
And the melodies that we played while never crossing paths

23:27.760 --> 23:33.470
I know I must not run away. The only path is straight ahead

23:33.470 --> 23:37.970
Even if this turns out to be a mistake

23:37.970 --> 23:43.560
The whirlpools of destiny will consume all loneliness

23:43.560 --> 23:51.660
It is an unerasable scar, an egoism that cannot be discarded

24:05.040 --> 24:10.050
Episode 6

24:05.040 --> 24:10.050
Terror Fading Into Death
